armk-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2019 Q2","e":"armk","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Bramlage","x":"Beyond these items, second quarter GAAP operating income was impacted by tax reform related one-time employee reinvestments partly offset by lower severance and lower merger related integration charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/13/aramark-armk-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2019 Q3","e":"armk","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Bramlage","x":"So they will pass through a large portion of that inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/aramark-armk-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2019 Q3","e":"armk","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Bramlage","x":"But on a year-over-year basis, the amount and the percentage of inflation that we're passing through is not radically different.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/aramark-armk-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2019 Q4","e":"armk","d":"2019-11-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Bramlage","x":"There has been some unrest in Chile, which has impacted our business, some uncertainty around tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/19/aramark-armk-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2020 Q1","e":"armk","d":"2020-02-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"John J. Zillmer","x":"So I think the down streaming of those resources, the repositioning of them, if you will, into higher education will help to accelerate that change.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/aramark-armk-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2020 Q2","e":"armk","d":"2020-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Ondrof","x":"In the period COVID-19 reduced revenue by an estimated $75 million offsetting the net new business growth strong account retention and price increases across multiple regions most notably in emerging markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/aramark-armk-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2020 Q2","e":"armk","d":"2020-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Seth Weber","x":"And then I was surprised I think I heard a couple of times mentioned about positive pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/aramark-armk-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2020 Q2","e":"armk","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Zillmer","x":"If a downturn continues or gets worse for some reason we have the flexibility to go ahead and take additional cost out that we haven't focused on yet because we're really focused on being able to rebuild the enterprise and to respond quickly to customer demand when that time comes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/aramark-armk-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2020 Q2","e":"armk","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John J. Zillmer","x":"And that is the terrific thing is we've been able to maintain contact with our the employees who have been furloughed and laid off we've maintained an active communications approach with them to keep them engaged.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/aramark-armk-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2020 Q3","e":"armk","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Ondrof","x":"In addition, GAAP operating loss, net loss and diluted loss per share included, most notably, $125 million in severance charges associated with actions taken to restructure and realign personnel resources within the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/aramark-armk-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2020 Q3","e":"armk","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Ondrof","x":"In the current environment, we have taken these actions to rightsize the business to create a fit-for-purpose organization that is best positioned to serve our clients and deliver strong sustainable performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/aramark-armk-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ARMK 2020 Q4","e":"armk","d":"2020-11-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Ondrof","x":"The company quickly and thoughtfully implemented in-unit cost reduction strategies, including renegotiation of client contracts, as well as reduced general corporate expenses, to manage the AOI drop-through rate to 22% on a constant currency basis during the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/17/aramark-armk-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARMK 2020 Q4","e":"armk","d":"2020-11-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Bardi","x":"I think you talked about some of the opportunities on the permanent cost savings like -- on the supply chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/17/aramark-armk-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARMK 2021 Q1","e":"armk","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Zillmer","x":"So, we did guide early on that we believe if we were in a long-term cost-cutting environment, we could get drop-through down to the 15% range, but we've been very disciplined about doing what's right in terms of the long-term health of the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/09/aramark-armk-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARMK 2021 Q2","e":"armk","d":"2021-05-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Ondrof","x":"Contractually in many cases, we're able to pass that on, particularly in this environment, more of a cost plus based environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/aramark-armk-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARMK 2021 Q3","e":"armk","d":"2021-08-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Ondrof","x":"As always, we're trying not to lean completely on passing that through as our contracts primarily allow us to do and manage it in other ways to provide that value to customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/10/aramark-armk-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARMK 2021 Q4","e":"armk","d":"2021-11-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Ondrof","x":"As John mentioned, we are encouraged by the rebounding base revenues with organic revenue reaching 87% of pre-COVID levels in the fourth quarter, slightly better-than-anticipated due to the acceleration of new account openings and higher-than-expected pricing pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/16/aramark-armk-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARMK 2021 Q4","e":"armk","d":"2021-11-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Ondrof","x":"The revenue outlook reflects a continued impact from COVID-19 in fiscal '22 of approximately $1.6 billion to $1.9 billion or 10% to 12% of pre-COVID revenue, partially offset by net new business wins and pricing pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/16/aramark-armk-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARMK 2021 Q4","e":"armk","d":"2021-11-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Zillmer","x":"We are currently in active deployment of our new field ordering technology for our managed services business, which will streamline our operators buying activities and ensure alignment with optimized supply chain programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/16/aramark-armk-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARMK 2025 Q4","e":"armk","d":"2025-11-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Steinerman","x":"When you talk about base business 